<title>NEW ZEALAND: New Zealand vehicle registrations rise in April.</title>
<headline>New Zealand vehicle registrations rise in April.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The total number of vehicle registrations in New Zealand in April was 19,779, up from 19,464 in March and 18,747 in April 1996, the Land Transport Safety Authority said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Registrations of new and ex-overseas vehicles totalled 18,295 in April versus 17,944 in March and 17,364 in April 1996. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
